# Build output. The host glue (./wit, src/bindings.rs, src/bridges.rs) IS committed so the
# host crate compiles in the workspace; a guest component's wit/ + bindings are regenerated
# by `rusm build` from bridges/ on every build, so they're output, not source.
/wasm/
/node_modules/
/components/*/wit/
/components/*/internal/
